WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.630
Joining us now: an empty chair.

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:04.450
We’ve got a big game Saturday.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:05.490
Any thoughts?

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:07.650
Take your time…

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.700
[Crickets]

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.030
Good talk.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.830
Still more responsive than some of you.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:16.890
You’ve got opinions about every hand ever played.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.490
Surely you can tell The Commish whether you’re coming.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:21.010
Open the yellow chip.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:22.130
Choose your name.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:23.170
Tap In,

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:23.750
Maybe,

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:24.510
or Out.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.350
It’s TLPT RSVP.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.000
Don’t make him interview the furniture.
